              "text": "بازرسی کردن (bâzrasi kardan) — \"to search, to inspect (bags or people)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در فرودگاه کیف مرا بازرسی کردند. Dar forudgâh kif-e marâ bâzrasi kardand. At the airport they searched my bag."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâzrasi 'inspection' + kardan. An inspector is a bâzras."
            }
          ]
        },
