          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bâzrasi kardan is built from native bâzrasi 'inspection', from bâz 'again, back' and ras, the stem of residan 'to reach', and kardan 'to do', inherited from Middle Persian kardan (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
